flowchart TD
    Start([Start Patient Registration]) --> InputDetails[Input Demographic Details]
    InputDetails --> ValidateData{Data Valid?}
    ValidateData -- No --> DisplayFieldError[Display Validation Error] --> InputDetails
    ValidateData -- Yes --> CheckDuplicate{Duplicate Found?}
    CheckDuplicate -- Yes --> DisplayDuplicateMsg[Display Existing UHID Alert] --> End([End Registration])
    CheckDuplicate -- No --> GenerateUHID[Generate Unique UHID]
    GenerateUHID --> SavePatient[Save Patient Entity to Database]
    SavePatient --> IssueUHIDCard[Issue UHID Card / Confirmation]
    IssueUHIDCard --> End
